# Deploy Everything After Changes

When making changes to the ia.ominis.org codebase, **always run deployment** for all affected components. Do not leave deployments to the user.

## Deployment Commands

| Component | Script | When to run |
|-----------|--------|-------------|
| Backend | `./infrastructure/20-sync-backend.sh` | After changes in `backend-haystack/**` |
| Frontend | `./infrastructure/12-sync-frontend.sh` | After changes in `frontend/**` |
| Pipecat agent | `./infrastructure/23a-deploy-liveavatar-production.sh` | After changes in `liveavatar-demo/**` |

## Deployment Order

1. **Backend** → `20-sync-backend.sh`
2. **Frontend** → `12-sync-frontend.sh`
3. **Pipecat agent** → `23a-deploy-liveavatar-production.sh` (bump image tag in `pcc-deploy.toml` if agent code changed)

## Bump Pipecat Image

When changing `liveavatar-demo/`, increment the image version in `liveavatar-demo/pcc-deploy.toml` before deploy (e.g., `0.2` → `0.3`).
